              "ObjectName": {
                "source": "mediawiki-metadata",
                "value": "Comrade Bethune's Unselfish Spirit poster"
              },
              "Permission": {
                "hidden": "",
                "source": "commons-desc-page",
                "value": "Section 3 Article 21 of the Copyright Law of the People's Republic of China (2010) states that copyright is maintained until a) 50 years after the death of a creator or b) when there is no given creator, 50 years after publication by the relevant legal entity/organization. Insofar as the painter is listed as \"Anonymous\" (佚名), ownership at best could be imputed to a Chinese Communist Party or Chinese government organ presumably responsible for such propaganda work. In this case, the 50 year limit expired on 31 December 2018 at the very latest."
              },
